<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-euplectella-aspergillum-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Euplectella aspergillum Turing wavenumber at 34.3 µm (Holocene, detail s0) — MorphoEval overall 85.1/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Same Schnakenberg law as Pass 1 (a=0.1, b=0.9, D_u=1, D_v=30, λ_c=3.43e-05 m, k_c=183183 m^-1, age 0 Ma). Dispersion Pearson r=0.999989, RMSE=0.00396, equal-diffusion σ_max=−0.1025, γ-sweep ratio 2. Pass 2 resamples the lattice at the mid-tube radius and leaves the osculum lip bare. CV similarity rises from 81.8 to 86.4 on the 12-frame 960×720 GIF. Coherency rises from 0.192 to 0.313 (specimen 0.505). Orientation KS falls from 0.075 to 0.045. Image radial Pearson is 0.948 and does not clear 0.98. Weighted score 85.1/100. Overall 85.1/100 (faithfulness 84.4, reproducibility 86.8); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit ed31c961; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 88, Morphological realism / specimen match 80, Parameter expressivity 86, Morphometric validation 86, Source and data traceability 90, Code-to-model traceability 84, Reproducibility package 86. Output judged: docs/media/euplectella_aspergillum_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-euplectella-aspergillum-turing-wavelength-s0.py at ed31c961, image/png, 719394 B, 1848×644 px, artifact_sha256 31028fa39db810dd610c01f1a689d327172cd2be0bb7a9be35a0b6c631013170 (sha256 31028fa39db810dd610c01f1a689d327172cd2be0bb7a9be35a0b6c631013170), spec_fingerprint 124c45a3077f43da708d297825fc3db1c1d902225fd1e9032d50f5b8e2db9ef2. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 124c45a3077f43da708d297825fc3db1c1d902225fd1e9032d50f5b8e2db9ef2; artifact_sha256: 31028fa39db810dd610c01f1a689d327172cd2be0bb7a9be35a0b6c631013170. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-27-euplectella-aspergillum-turing-wavelength-s0-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Aizenberg et al. 2005: seven hierarchical levels and a cylindrical square lattice reinforced by diagonal ridges. | Weaver et al. 2007: assembly of the siliceous lattice of E. aspergillum. | Turing 1952: dispersion relation and critical wavenumber.; reconstructed_in_script: Schnakenberg linearisation and σ(k), calibrated to λ_c=3.43e-05 m. | Four-mode amplitude equations on |k|=k_c, drawn with a fixed reference radius. | Equal-diffusion ablation, γ sweep, specimen-crop Pearson, RMSE, and KS.; transfer_boundary: Cohort wording 'pigment stripe / ocellus' names a skeletal-lattice wavelength. The portrait magnifies λ_c.; does_not_claim: That this sponge has ocelli or pigment stripes. | That the image radial Pearson exceeded 0.98. It is 0.948. | That Monn et al. 2015 lamella thicknesses were fitted, or that a second specimen was scored. | A chronospecies split. Holocene only, 0 Ma, chronoseries 1/1.." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "open need [independent_assessor/model-fidelity, pressure P=0.65]: Pass 2 is still scored by the builder.",
        "open need [specimen_comparison/specimen-match, pressure P=1.1]: Only one public-domain photograph is vendored.",
        "remediation needed: {'id': 'R1', 'item': 'Resolved in this pass: circumferential arc uses the mid-tube radius; osculum lips are unpatterned.', 'status': 'resolved'}",
        "remediation needed: {'id': 'R2', 'item': 'Partly resolved: coherency 0.192 → 0.313. Specimen coherency is still 0.505. Not closed by pasting the photograph.', 'status': 'resolved'}",
        "remediation needed: {'id': 'R3', 'item': \"Image radial Pearson is 0.948, not above 0.98. Dispersion Pearson is 0.999989 and is the law's goodness-of-fit.\", 'status': 'open'}",
        "remediation needed: {'id': 'R4', 'item': 'Second specimen still absent.', 'status': 'open'}",
        "remediation needed: {'id': 'R5', 'item': 'Independent second assessor still absent.', 'status': 'open'}" ;
    pk:hasScore 8.51e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

